                                "sense_id": "a85e9d72-f4e0-31eb-abad-f7cb253b3696",
                                "text": "Notice the difference. Weighing and unweighing will help you make good, quick turns."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e58bded-da19-480e-ae50-939f5eaf0032",
                                "sense_id": "a85e9d72-f4e0-31eb-abad-f7cb253b3696",
                                "text": "The turn is helped with a slight unweighing of the skate blade produced by a very subtle upward bounce."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3f9fe01-1faf-405c-a518-ebcc0c9ebdc6",
                                "sense_id": "a85e9d72-f4e0-31eb-abad-f7cb253b3696",
                                "text": "As proposed in Fig. 5 (see also Fig. 13) this very short but quick downward arm movement will cause a short but quick unweighing action with the resulting pre-stretch in the knee-extensor muscles ."
                            }
                        ]
